{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS主机上Python首次拉起Shell。对应需求：执行。官方：First Time Python Spawned a Shell on Host。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS主机上Python首次拉起Shell","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS主机上Python首次拉起Shell\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://blog.trailofbits.com/2024/06/11/exploiting-ml-models-with-pickle-file-attacks-part-1/","https://github.com/trailofbits/fickling","https://5stars217.github.io/2024-03-04-what-enables-malicious-models/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"92a36c98-b24a-4bf7-aac7-1eac71fa39cf","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:macos and event.type:start and event.action:exec and\nprocess.parent.name:python* and\nprocess.name:(bash or dash or sh or tcsh or csh or zsh or ksh or fish) and process.args:\"-c\" and\nnot process.command_line:(*pip* or *conda* or *brew* or *jupyter*)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"},{"id":"T1059.006","name":"Python","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id","process.parent.executable"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
